{"id":"653635","name":"香辣萝卜干","author":"涵涵麻麻123","authorId":"13114789","desc":"","cover":"images/653635/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"3斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"芝麻","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"五香粉","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"花椒粉","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"辣椒粉","amount":"一勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"把萝卜清洗干净。","img":"images/653635/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把萝卜切成自己想要的厚度长短。","img":"images/653635/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"然后就是晾晒，晒至八九成干，这个过程需要两三天。","img":"images/653635/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"晒好的萝卜干用开水烫一会。","img":"images/653635/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"烫好的萝卜干挤干水分，有时间可以在晾晒一会让表面没有水分可以放的久一点。","img":"images/653635/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后就是调料了，准备一勺芝麻。","img":"images/653635/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"一勺五香粉。","img":"images/653635/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"一勺花椒粉。","img":"images/653635/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"一勺辣椒面。","img":"images/653635/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"半勺盐。","img":"images/653635/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"味达美两勺。","img":"images/653635/step_11.jpeg"},{"step":12,"desc":"蚝油适量。","img":"images/653635/step_12.jpeg"},{"step":13,"desc":"然后把花生油烧热泼到辣椒面上，瞬间辣椒面的香味就出来了。","img":"images/653635/step_13.jpeg"},{"step":14,"desc":"最后用我们温柔的小手抓拌均匀。","img":"images/653635/step_14.jpeg"},{"step":15,"desc":"美味出炉啦。","img":"images/653635/step_15.jpeg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}